      "card_ids": ["C52","C45"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L4 records are formulation/dissolution studies for other molecules (risperidone, voriconazole, fluconazole, BMS-955829) and do not provide query-specific permeability or solubility evidence; they neither support nor contradict the high prediction.",
